    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to Heron's Lock, an exciting new neighbourhood in Lucan that brings together the best of modern living and natural beauty.\n\nWelcome to Heron's Lock, an exciting new neighbourhood in Lucan that brings together the best of modern living and natural beauty. Positioned right beside the scenic Grand Canal and designed around acres of green spaces, this is a place where life flows effortlessly. Stroll through landscaped parks and enjoying a vibrant community with everything you need close at hand. Heron's Lock is brought to you by Evara, an Irish developer building transformational neighbourhoods and affordable, quality homes for people and communities across Ireland \n wherever they are in life.\n\nHeron's Lock will feature a stunning range of 2, 3 and 4-bedroom homes, each thoughtfully designed to suit contemporary lifestyles. Every home is A-rated for energy efficiency, combining smart layouts with premium finishes to create spaces that are stylish, comfortable, and sustainable. Whether you're looking for a spacious family home or a well designed duplex, Heron's Lock offers something for everyone.\n\nWhy choose Heron's Lock?\n\n• A-rated, energy-efficient homes for lower running costs and greener living\n• Smartly designed interiors with high-quality finishes\n• Near acres of parks, greenways, and canal-side walks\n• Excellent local amenities: schools, cafés, shops and sports & leisure facilities \n• A short stroll from The Crossings, Adamstown, for shopping and leisure\n• Superb transport links via Adamstown Train Station and Dublin Bus (L53/P29/C1)\n\nThis is more than a development. It's a community where nature and daily life blend seamlessly. With outstanding connectivity and a wealth of amenities, Heron's Lock offers the perfect balance of convenience and calm.\n\nLaunching Spring 2026\n\nThe initial releases will consist of 2-bedroom own door apartments, 3-bedroom duplexes and 3 & 4-bedroom houses. Prices will be confirmed closer to launch, in preparation please register your details today to receive updates when they become available and be among the first to hear when these beautiful homes are released for sale.\n \nHeron's Lock where life flows home.\n\nhttps://evara.ie/development/herons-lock/"
      },
